    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"The capability to predict seismic intensity and several parameters of ground motion resulting from earthquakes in California and the conterminous United States (USA-48) is provided by the programs and data bases included on these disks (GD-MOTIONl and GD-MOTION2). In addition, numerous analyses have already been conducted using these programs, many of such results being included on these disks.\"",
